  "body": ">[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> For Node 18, 20: `dd-trace-js` version is [v5.126.0](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/releases/tag/v5.126.0)\r\n> For Nodejs 22+ `dd-trace-js` version is [v6.15.0](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/releases/tag/v6.15.0)\r\n\r\n>[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> This layer is currently unavailable in aws region `me-south-1`, due to unrelated incidents\r\n\r\n>[!NOTE]\r\n> Nodejs 26 is now available!\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Sign the datadog-lambda-js ci image by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/809\r\n* Pin serverless version by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/810\r\n* Remove use of Github secrets by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/811\r\n* Add Node26 runtime by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/808\r\n* Migration Parity Markdown File by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/812\r\n* fix: update pprof prebuild cleanup for @datadog/pprof 5.14.4 by @lucaspimentel in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/813\r\n* test: add local Docker/RIE integration test harness (Level 2 tests) by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/804\r\n* feat: use DD_SERVICE for inferred spans when integration service names are removed by @zarirhamza in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/814\r\n* fix(appsec): send the normalized status code on end-invocation by @CarlesDD in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/817\r\n* perf(runtime): use dd-trace loader registration by @BridgeAR in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/819\r\n* perf(metrics): remove per-send completion promises by @BridgeAR in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/820\r\n* test: expand local integration harness to old-suite coverage parity by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/821\r\n* chore: Update usage doc for publish_sandbox.sh by @lym953 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/690\r\n* test: cover callback handlers, fetch, metrics-only, payload capture in local integration harness by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/823\r\n* ci(integration): stabilize Lambda log snapshots by @BridgeAR in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/824\r\n* fix(deps): vuln patch: brace-expansion, js-yaml [package.json] by @gh-worker-campaigns-3e9aa4[bot] in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/822\r\n* fix(deps): vuln browserslist (minor → 4.28.9) [package.json] by @gh-worker-campaigns-3e9aa4[bot] in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/827\r\n* tests: local integ tests cover both arm64 and amd64 by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/828\r\n* Update Dependencies by @datadog-lambda-js-bot[bot] in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/798\r\n* support ddtrace v6 for node > 22 by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/818\r\n* bump dd-trace v6 by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/832\r\n* fix(deps): pin import-in-the-middle to 3.4.0 by @joeyzhao2018 in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/835\r\n* fix: support installs without yarn.lock by @pabloerhard in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/836\r\n* v12.143.0 by @ojproductions in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/834\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @lucaspimentel made their first contribution in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/813\r\n* @BridgeAR made their first contribution in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/819\r\n* @datadog-lambda-js-bot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/pull/798\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Layer ARNs\r\n```\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node18-x:143\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node20-x:143\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node22-x:143\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node24-x:143\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Node26-x:143\r\n\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node18-x:143\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node20-x:143\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node22-x:143\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node24-x:143\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:002406178527:layer:Datadog-Node26-x:143\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-js/compare/v12.142.0...v12.143.0",
